=== main ===

%:;&::%:;%:& ...H-ello?...%:;&::%:;%:& Atlas! You’re operational! #layout:left #portrait:Handler #speaker:The Handler

Pardon our dust. I wasn't expecting any more of you to boot up, especially so soon. 

It's a miracle that your I.S.P is still functional too! It should tell you basic info about your surroundings.

I'm opening up a door so you can get acclimated to your new body in our training facility. Don't over exert yourself out there! {openDoor()}

We're counting on you.
